create them for our kids, and yours. <\/p><p>We seek to do that through innovative, but affordable products for babies and kids. I am a parent of two, Lillian and Maximilian, (hence the name), and was frustrated by the dearth of quality products that are also affordable.<\/p><p>Its either some Amazon junk or prohibitively expensive, we sought out to change that.<\/p><p>Our first line of products are aimed at  addressing unmet needs of using a stroller on the go, following that we will soon launch a line of travel-focused baby and kids products.<\/p><p>We hope to offer our customers honesty, transparency, and an open door for any questions, comments, or concerns about our products. We are here to help you become a better parent and maybe make parenting a bit easier in the process.<\/p><p>Looking to making my customers day soon!<\/p><p><br\/>Cheers!<br\/>James<br\/>Founder<br\/>Lil & Mil<\/p>","page":""}},"description":{"type":"description","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon":"none","icon_width":20,"collapse_content":true}},"judge_me_reviews_review_widget_KMAhYq":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/judge-me-reviews\/blocks\/review_widget\/61ccd3b1-a9f2-4160-9fe9-4fec8413e5d8","settings":{"review_data":"sample_data","max_width":1200}},"separator":{"type":"separator","settings":{}},"66af2bc0-545e-43fe-b603-e60f3db6bf2f":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"liquid":""}}},"block_order":["title","vendor","price","variant_picker","badges","payment_terms","06f56b92-c8a4-4117-8a0e-6f2c5e82e67e","judge_me_reviews_preview_badge_W37UcM","quantity_selector","5a6fa0e9-f4b0-4caf-a1fa-83a7ab582a60","collapsible_text_zxtRni","collapsible_text_EwMmfx","collapsible_text_xNNf4B","description","judge_me_reviews_review_widget_KMAhYq","separator","66af2bc0-545e-43fe-b603-e60f3db6bf2f"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"show_fixed_add_to_cart":true,"desktop_media_width":65,"desktop_media_layout":"grid_highlight","mobile_media_size":"expanded","mobile_carousel_control":"dots","enable_video_autoplay":true,"enabl